<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header">
<div class="section-label" data-i18n="transaction.label">Transaction</div>
<h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="transaction.title">事务控制。</h2>
</div>
<p class="section-intro" data-i18n="transaction.desc">SQLServerTransactionManager 支持五种隔离级别，含 SQL Server 专有 SNAPSHOT。支持 SET LOCK_TIMEOUT / DEADLOCK_PRIORITY。</p>
<div class="code-block" style="margin-top: 24px;"><div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">transaction_control.py</span></div>
<div class="code-body"><pre><span class="tok-k">from</span> rhosocial.activerecord.backend.transaction <span class="tok-k">import</span> <span class="tok-cls">IsolationLevel</span>

<span class="tok-c"># 标准事务（默认 READ COMMITTED）</span>
<span class="tok-k">with</span> backend.transaction():
    backend.execute(<span class="tok-s">"INSERT INTO users ..."</span>, ())

<span class="tok-c"># 指定隔离级别</span>
<span class="tok-k">with</span> backend.transaction(isolation_level=<span class="tok-cls">IsolationLevel</span>.SERIALIZABLE):
    ...

<span class="tok-c"># SQL Server 五种隔离级别</span>
<span class="tok-c"># READ_UNCOMMITTED</span>
<span class="tok-c"># READ_COMMITTED  (默认)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># REPEATABLE_READ</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SERIALIZABLE</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SNAPSHOT — SQL Server 专有！</span>

<span class="tok-c"># SNAPSHOT 隔离级别（行版本控制）</span>
<span class="tok-k">with</span> backend.transaction(snapshot=<span class="tok-k">True</span>):
    result = backend.execute(<span class="tok-s">"SELECT ..."</span>, ())

<span class="tok-c"># Savepoint 支持</span>
<span class="tok-k">with</span> backend.transaction():
    backend.execute(<span class="tok-s">"INSERT ..."</span>, ())
    <span class="tok-k">with</span> backend.transaction():  <span class="tok-c"># SAVE TRANSACTION</span>
        backend.execute(<span class="tok-s">"UPDATE ..."</span>, ())

<span class="tok-c"># 注意：SQL Server 中 ROLLBACK 回滚所有嵌套层</span>
<span class="tok-c"># 嵌套事务使用 SQLServerNestedTransactionManager</span>

<span class="tok-c"># 锁控制</span>
backend.set_lock_timeout(<span class="tok-n">5000</span>)      <span class="tok-c"># SET LOCK_TIMEOUT 5000</span>
backend.set_deadlock_priority(<span class="tok-n">10</span>)  <span class="tok-c"># SET DEADLOCK_PRIORITY 10</span></pre></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header">
<div class="section-label" data-i18n="async.label">Async</div>
<h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="async.title">异步支持。</h2>
</div>
<p class="section-intro" data-i18n="async.desc">AsyncSQLServerBackend 懒加载，使用 aioodbc 异步驱动。注意：继承同步 StorageBackend 基类。</p>
<div class="code-block" style="margin-top: 24px;"><div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">async_sqlserver.py</span></div>
<div class="code-body"><pre><span class="tok-k">from</span> rhosocial.activerecord.backend.impl.sqlserver <span class="tok-k">import</span> <span class="tok-cls">AsyncSQLServerBackend</span>
<span class="tok-c"># 需安装: pip install rhosocial-activerecord-sqlserver[async]</span>

backend = <span class="tok-cls">AsyncSQLServerBackend</span>(
    host=<span class="tok-s">'localhost'</span>,
    port=<span class="tok-n">1433</span>,
    database=<span class="tok-s">'app_db'</span>,
    username=<span class="tok-s">'sa'</span>,
    password=<span class="tok-s">'YourPassword123'</span>,
)
<span class="tok-k">await</span> backend.connect()

<span class="tok-k">async with</span> backend.transaction():
    result = <span class="tok-k">await</span> backend.execute(<span class="tok-s">"SELECT ..."</span>, ())

<span class="tok-k">await</span> backend.disconnect()

<span class="tok-c"># 懒加载：同步组件不依赖异步驱动</span>
<span class="tok-k">from</span> rhosocial.activerecord.backend.impl.sqlserver <span class="tok-k">import</span> <span class="tok-cls">SQLServerBackend</span>         <span class="tok-c"># ✓</span>
<span class="tok-k">from</span> rhosocial.activerecord.backend.impl.sqlserver <span class="tok-k">import</span> <span class="tok-cls">AsyncSQLServerBackend</span> <span class="tok-c"># ✗ 需要异步驱动</span></pre></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header">
<div class="section-label" data-i18n="env_config.label">Environment</div>
<h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="env_config.title">环境变量配置。</h2>
</div>
<div class="code-block" style="margin-top: 24px;"><div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">env_config.py</span></div>
<div class="code-body"><pre><span class="tok-k">from</span> rhosocial.activerecord.backend.impl.sqlserver.config <span class="tok-k">import</span> <span class="tok-cls">SQLServerConnectionConfig</span>

<span class="tok-c"># 从环境变量创建配置（前缀 SQLSERVER_）</span>
config = <span class="tok-cls">SQLServerConnectionConfig</span>.from_env(prefix=<span class="tok-s">"SQLSERVER_"</span>)

<span class="tok-c"># 支持的环境变量：</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_HOST     — 主机地址 (默认 localhost)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_PORT     — 端口号 (默认 1433)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_DATABASE — 数据库名 (必填)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_USERNAME — 用户名</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_PASSWORD — 密码</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_DRIVER   — ODBC 驱动名</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_ENCRYPT  — 加密连接 (默认 True)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_TRUST_SERVER_CERTIFICATE — 信任服务器证书</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_POOL_SIZE — 连接池大小</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_CHARSET  — 字符集 (默认 UTF-8)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_AUTOCOMMIT — 自动提交 (默认 True)</span>
<span class="tok-c"># SQLSERVER_TRUSTED_CONNECTION — Windows 身份验证</span></pre></div>
</div>
</div>
